# Test classpath only. Spring merges every META-INF/spring.factories it finds, so
# this adds to src/main/resources/META-INF/spring.factories rather than replacing
# it. TestDatabaseGuard refuses, before anything connects, to start any
# application whose database is not the test database. See its KDoc.
org.springframework.context.ApplicationListener=\
tech.bhrigu.almira.support.TestDatabaseGuard
